      "created_at": "2015-01-16T21:23:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Once upon a time, Pydro &amp; I has posted a couple living campaigns - weekly scenarios where in the results of one week affected storyline and possible matchups for future matchups.</p><p>I'm about to start a several-week hiatus between projects at one of my jobs which will leave me with more time on my hands than normal. Is there any interest in me posting another series, probably based on the petered-out storyline from the first one that I was attempting the first time? I promise to try to avoid WCos material until our UK friends might reasonably have it.</p>",
